.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLYPHASTORE_MIGRATE_STORE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glyphastore_migrate_store
.Nd offline Worker reshard of a GlyphaStore data directory
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hV
.Op Fl Fl json
.Op Fl Fl no-scan
.Fl Fl workers Ar N
.Ar source-data-dir destination-data-dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
performs an offline Worker reshard / logical rewrite (GlyphaStore
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@ ) .
.Sy Stop writers first.
It verifies the source, copies every live key/value/expiry into a new
destination Store created with
.Fl Fl workers Ar N ,
checkpoints progress in
.Pa destination.migrate-state ,
verifies the destination, then removes the checkpoint.
.Pp
Re-run the same command to resume after interrupt.
The source is never mutated.
The same Worker count is allowed as an offline rewrite into a new Store
identity.
Online resharding is not supported.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl Fl help
Show help and exit 0.
.It Fl V , Fl Fl version
Show version and exit 0.
.It Fl Fl json
Emit a stable JSON report on stdout.
.It Fl Fl no-scan
Skip committed Record scans during source/destination verify.
.It Fl w Ar N , Fl Fl workers Ar N
Destination Worker count (required, 1..256).
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Success.
.It 1
Validation, migration, or I/O failure.
.It 2
Usage error.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glyphastore 7 ,
.Xr glyphastore_verify_store 1 ,
.Xr glyphastore_backup_store 1
.Pp
Source docs:
.Pa docs/architecture/store-migration.md ,
.Pa docs/operations/worker-resharding.md .
.Sh AUTHORS
GlyphaStore contributors.
